<title>JAMAICA: SOCCER-ST. VINCENT-JAMAICA QUALIFIER POSTPONED.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ST. VINCENT-JAMAICA QUALIFIER POSTPONED.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The St. Vincent-Jamaica</p>
<p>CONCACAF semifinal stage group three World Cup qualifying</p>
<p>match set for Sunday was postponed due to rain and will be</p>
<p>played Monday.</p>
</text>
